        "Unstructured electronic invoices"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Procure > Finalise and publish procurement pack",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Unstructured electronic invoices"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Unstructured electronic invoices",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This PPN applies to all central government departments, including their executive agencies and non-departmental public bodies (collectively referred to as 'in-scope organisations').",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Unstructured electronic invoices",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In-scope organisations should accept \"unstructured\" electronic invoices (i.e. not machine-readable) if suppliers choose to submit invoices in that form. This may require removing any prohibitions from contracts on the use of electronic invoicing (e-invoicing); or any explicit or implicit requirements and / or terms to submit invoices only in paper form.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Unstructured electronic invoices",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This PPN is without prejudice to PPN 03/19: 'The Public Procurement (Electronic Invoices, etc) Regulations 2019'.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Unstructured electronic invoices",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Unstructured electronic invoices",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The procurement documents should confirm the acceptance of \"unstructured\" e-invoices.",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Unstructured electronic invoices",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Unstructured electronic invoices",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In-scope organisations should:",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Unstructured electronic invoices",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure the procurement documents confirm that “unstructured” e-invoices are permitted if suppliers choose to submit invoices in that form",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Unstructured electronic invoices",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "remove any prohibition from contracts on the use of e-invoicing including explicit or implicit requirements and / or terms to submit invoices only in paper form.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Unstructured electronic invoices",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Unstructured electronic invoices",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The PPN should be read alongside the relevant parts of the legal framework, including but not limited to, the following provisions of the Public Contracts Regulations 2015 (which may be particularly relevant to the consideration of this PPN):",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Unstructured electronic invoices",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Regulation 113A: Contractual provisions relating to the processing of electronic invoices",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Unstructured electronic invoices",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Additional support and guidance",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Unstructured electronic invoices",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Make sure you:",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Unstructured electronic invoices",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "read the PPN and any supporting implementation guidance",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Unstructured electronic invoices",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "seek legal and commercial advice in the context of specific procurements",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Unstructured electronic invoices",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
